    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T19:13:28Z",
    "body": "Coordinator: this issue stays open for now. A pass on one machine does not show that the fault is gone.\n\n- The crash was seen one time, on the runner `uma`, at commit 87fb95f29. No run of `uma` after that commit has completed the step `ui suites: lib` yet (the later green runs were on `wopr-2` and `cheese`).\n- No commit between 87fb95f29 and 6e641dac7 changes `crates/ui` or `crates/gpu` start code, so \"already fixed on main\" has no change that explains it.\n- The new pin (`gpu_probe_and_headless_render_survive_parallel_start`) is a good test. A PR that adds it is welcome, with `Refs` to this issue.\n\nClose condition: three green runs of `ui suites: lib` on `uma` after 87fb95f29, or a found cause. I record each run of `uma` here. If the crash comes again, the core dump of the runner is the next step.\n",
